/-- The elementary pointwise estimate behind Peetre's inequality:
`1 + ‖x‖ ^ 2 ≤ 2 * (1 + ‖x - y‖ ^ 2) * (1 + ‖y‖ ^ 2)`, obtained from
`‖x‖ ≤ ‖x - y‖ + ‖y‖` and `2 * ‖x - y‖ * ‖y‖ ≤ ‖x - y‖ ^ 2 + ‖y‖ ^ 2`. -/
lemma one_add_norm_sq_le {E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E]
