`∫⁻ x in Set.Ioo 0 (1/(n+1)), ‖f x‖ → 0`; then squeeze via
`‖∫ x in s, f x‖ ≤ ∫⁻ x in s, ‖f x‖` and `MeasureTheory.lintegral_mono_set`
(for `0 < t < 1/(n+1)`, `Set.Ioc 0 t ⊆ Set.Ioo 0 (1/(n+1))`). -/
