  --   `|p q σ| = √(|p²σ| · |q²σ|) ≤ (|p²σ| + |q²σ|) / 2`
  -- holds for *all* `θ` (AM–GM on `|p²σ|, |q²σ| ≥ 0`), so no sign information on `σ` is needed;
  -- in particular `hσ` is not used, and `s` need not be measurable.
