  -- `v²(1-v) ≤ 4/27` (from `4/27 - v² + v³ = (v-2/3)²(v+1/3) ≥ 0`), and
  -- `v³(1-v)² = v(1-v) · v²(1-v)`, so the product is `≤ (1/4)(4/27) = 1/27 ≤ 1/25`.
